This is NOT the REFERENCE CONFIGURATION dry density (that is dd1600).

Official benchmark specs (MSXX theoretical_benchmarking.tex, Table TH-G_model_parameters):
  Geometry: single-element constant-volume (no geometric dimensions required)
  Implemented reference cell: 1 cm x 1 cm (L = 1e-2 m)
  Initial suction: 100 MPa  →  pressure_ic = -1e8 Pa
  Hydration BC (bottom): suction ramp 100→0 MPa over 20 days (1728000 s),
                          then 0 MPa constant for 180 days  (total 200 days = 17280000 s)
  van Genuchten WRC: P0=27 MPa, alpha=0.45
  Permeability: Kozeny-Carman, k0 at phi0 (from k_ref=5.6e-21 m² at phi_ref=0.42)
  Liquid relative permeability: S_e^3  (A=1, n=3)
  Solid density: 2780 kg/m³
-->
